      "content": "Albanians in Montenegro (, Albanian: \"Shqiptarët e Malit të Zi\" ) constitute 4.91% of the county's total population. Albanians of Montenegro are Ghegs who mainly live in southeastern and eastern Montenegro, mainly in the following municipalities: Ulcinj (71% of population), Plav (19%), Bar (6%), Podgorica (5%) and Rožaje (5%).",
